\n\nThere are $2$ columns in $T$ and $2$ rows in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $T$ equals the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $T$ and $S$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{T}_{3\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{✓}{S}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $T$ and $4$ rows in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $T$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $T$ and $R$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{T}_{3\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{R}_{4\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $4$ columns in $S$ and $4$ rows in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $S$ equals the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $S$ and $R$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{S}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\times }_{✓}{R}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nThe products $TS$ and $SR$ are well defined. The product $TR$ is undefined."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186633780 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100869 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "010b6a43-0aec-5e8b-b1b4-e87f514925cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633748} {:answer/id #uuid "8eaee313-43e2-5821-99db-3c68fd211423" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633773}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "010b6a43-0aec-5e8b-b1b4-e87f514925cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633748} :answer-field/id #uuid "08c99501-9708-5e1a-b815-ca3fa93508da" :answer-field/key "The product $YZ$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633749} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "74e83aaf-fb37-5a6f-bb49-22b36d72678d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633767} {:answer/id #uuid "b83f6bad-5fa0-53df-ae0b-139897db13db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633783}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "74e83aaf-fb37-5a6f-bb49-22b36d72678d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633767} :answer-field/id #uuid "766b733c-6fcb-50fd-b7ca-61448521d360" :answer-field/key "The product $ZY$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633768} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "37b964ac-4b64-5f50-a3b1-a36bf7339f6e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633753} {:answer/id #uuid "c1a56745-459b-5905-adbe-d8954125e6af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633785}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c1a56745-459b-5905-adbe-d8954125e6af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633785} :answer-field/id #uuid "873a0c69-49b3-5419-a4f6-72708f1aa3c1" :answer-field/key "The product $XY$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633770}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "aabbdeae-7b53-5f2a-a7db-7cc80229726a" :question/problem "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$X=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -3 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -7 & 6 \\\\ -8 & -6 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Y=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 8 & 0 \\\\ -9 & 8 & -8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Z=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 7 \\\\ -5 & -6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $X,Y,$ and $Z?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Notice that $X$ is a $3\\times 3$ matrix, $Y$ is a $2\\times 3$ matrix, and $Z$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nThere are $3$ columns in $Y$ and $2$ rows in $Z.$ Since the number of columns in $Y$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $Z,$ the matrices $Y$ and $Z$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{Y}_{2\\times 3}{\\times }_{\\ne }{Z}_{2\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $3$ columns in $X$ and $2$ rows in $Y.$ Since the number of columns in $X$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $Y,$ the matrices $X$ and $Y$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{X}_{3\\times 3}{\\times }_{\\ne }{Y}_{2\\times 3}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $2$ columns in $Z$ and $2$ rows in $Y.$ Since the number of columns in $Z$ equals the number of rows in $Y,$ the matrices $Z$ and $Y$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{Z}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{✓}{Y}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 3}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nThe product $ZY$ is well defined. The products $YZ$ and $XY$ are undefined."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186633784 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100869 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4a8d85ca-3230-5bff-b6bb-5d8e7be5ba43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186633759} {:answer/id #uuid "f10cbc85-4b0a-5f6f-a899-f391e7493dd8" :answer/type {:db/id #e